==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a base hit stage, so feel free to stall for cash and build a strong frontline before hitting the base.

Due to the presence of [[Le'Solar]] as the boss, you'll need to bring a Barrier Breaker, or just someone that can hit super hard. Once that's covered, you can just focus on bringing peon clearers like [[Housewife Cat]] and [[Manic Macho Legs Cat]] to clear out the Brollow horde.

